  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large cast-iron skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the zucchini, bell pepper, and onion to the skillet and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Create 4 wells in the vegetable mixture and crack an egg into each well.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 15-20 minutes, or until the eggs are cooked through.",
    "Sprinkle the feta cheese, chili flakes, and fresh basil leaves over the top of the eggs.",
    "Drizzle the lemon juice over the eggs and serve with bread, if desired."
